# Allowlist. Nothing is published unless it is named below.
#
# Deliberately NOT here:
#   case4-value-model/data/    2.9 GB of raw listings plus the 97 MB unified table. Several
#                              sources carry no licence or a research-only one (see
#                              case4-value-model/DATASETS.md, "Licence to check before
#                              publishing"), so none of it is redistributed. download_data.py
#                              and build_reference.py rebuild all of it from the original sources.
#   Case Study *.pdf           Capgemini's own competition material; not ours to republish.
#   internal working notes     the audit, the handoff, the storyline and the methods note.
#   the slides, the strategy   the deck, its guides, the solution document and the primary research.
#   ledger/dashboard/          a presentation deliverable, kept back like the slides.
#   local_repos/               the prototypes' local histories; only their files are published.
/*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE
!Case4_Value_at_Risk.xlsx

!case4-value-model/
case4-value-model/*
!case4-value-model/*.py
!case4-value-model/requirements.txt
!case4-value-model/assumptions.csv
!case4-value-model/work_list.csv
!case4-value-model/DATASETS.md
!case4-value-model/METHODOLOGY_multi_dataset.md

!case4-value-model/analysis/
case4-value-model/analysis/*
!case4-value-model/analysis/*.py
!case4-value-model/analysis/*.md
!case4-value-model/analysis/*.csv
# readiness_mileage_facts.json: the scalars the layer 2 report needs to be rebuilt without
# re-streaming 4.6 GB of MOT data. Added deliberately; it is the only json published.
!case4-value-model/analysis/*.json

!case4-value-model/loaders/
case4-value-model/loaders/*
!case4-value-model/loaders/*.py

# The two prototypes: code and reports only.
!case4-value-model/leak1/
case4-value-model/leak1/*
!case4-value-model/leak1/*.py
!case4-value-model/leak1/*.md

!case4-value-model/ledger/
case4-value-model/ledger/*
!case4-value-model/ledger/*.py
!case4-value-model/ledger/*.md
